  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 1.29,
      "e": 4.52,
      "text": "^- Good afternoon, men and women of the 136th."
    },
    {
      "s": 4.52,
      "e": 7.08,
      "text": "^We just want to say we're so very proud of the actions"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.08,
      "e": 10.75,
      "text": "we've taken in response to Hurricane Harvey."
    },
    {
      "s": 10.94,
      "e": 12.18,
      "text": "Everyone has stepped up."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.18,
      "e": 15.28,
      "text": "We've make a huge difference in what we've done here."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.28,
      "e": 16.45,
      "text": "I'm so proud of the wing"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.45,
      "e": 18.49,
      "text": "and every person that has contributed."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.49,
      "e": 20.87,
      "text": "I know not everyone sees the direct results,"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.87,
      "e": 24.25,
      "text": "but we have set records supporting our folks"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.25,
      "e": 26.51,
      "text": "of all along the East Coast."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.51,
      "e": 28.17,
      "text": "We have saved lives."
    },
    {
      "s": 28.33,
      "e": 30.27,
      "text": "Delivered tons of cargo, and people,"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.27,
      "e": 33.73,
      "text": "I am so very proud of us, the way we've stepped up."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.73,
      "e": 36.7,
      "text": "The state is proud, our nation is proud."
    },
    {
      "s": 36.7,
      "e": 39.38,
      "text": "Your entire leadership team is so very thankful"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.38,
      "e": 43.27,
      "text": "for the citizen airmen who came and answered the call."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.27,
      "e": 45.22,
      "text": "And Texans supported Texans,"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.22,
      "e": 47.88,
      "text": "making our fellow citizens safe."
    },
    {
      "s": 48.2,
      "e": 49.28,
      "text": "I can tell you right now,"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.28,
      "e": 51.42,
      "text": "I couldn't be more proud of the wing."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.42,
      "e": 54.09,
      "text": "And we are truly Nulli Secundus."
    },
    {
      "s": 55.19,
      "e": 56.83,
      "text": "^- I want to echo the sentiments"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.83,
      "e": 58.9,
      "text": "^that Colonel Holt had identified."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.9,
      "e": 60.62,
      "text": "^I am extremely proud of all the men and women"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.62,
      "e": 62.51,
      "text": "^that are out there doing what they're doing,"
    },
    {
      "s": 62.51,
      "e": 63.78,
      "text": "every single day."
    },
    {
      "s": 63.78,
      "e": 65.44,
      "text": "I know all of you are tired."
    },
    {
      "s": 65.44,
      "e": 67.48,
      "text": "I know all of you are working as hard as you can."
    },
    {
      "s": 67.48,
      "e": 68.9,
      "text": "I want you to continue to do it."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.9,
      "e": 72.06,
      "text": "Please make sure that you look out for each other."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.06,
      "e": 73.71,
      "text": "Look each other in the eyes to make sure"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.71,
      "e": 75.3,
      "text": "that you're being taken care of"
    },
    {
      "s": 75.3,
      "e": 77.9,
      "text": "and you're seeing what needs to be done"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.9,
      "e": 80.31,
      "text": "to be able to take care of our people."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.31,
      "e": 83.03,
      "text": "Truly appreciate everybody stepping up to do this."
    },
    {
      "s": 83.03,
      "e": 84.4,
      "text": "This is what we train for."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.4,
      "e": 86.45,
      "text": "This is why we became guardsmen."
    },
    {
      "s": 86.45,
      "e": 88.52,
      "text": "We're going to continue doing it every single day."
    },
    {
      "s": 88.52,
      "e": 89.35,
      "text": "Keep it up."
    },
    {
      "s": 89.35,
      "e": 91.32,
      "text": "We're going to be done soon."
    }
  ],
